msgid "IP Version doesn't match with Bind Network Address in Redundant Channel"
msgstr "ເວີຊັນຂອງ IP ບໍ່ກົງກັບທີ່ຢູ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຜູກໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງສຳຮອງ"

#: src/include/cluster/dialogs.rb:278
